            <li>Cancellation terms depend on the policy shown for the booking.</li>
            <li>Guests and hosts should first communicate to resolve booking concerns.</li>
            <li>Dwellr may review disputes and take action when these terms are violated.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="h4">5. Content and Conduct</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>You retain responsibility for content you upload to Dwellr.</li>
            <li>Content must not infringe another person’s rights or contain misleading information.</li>
            <li>Dwellr may remove content or suspend accounts that breach these terms.</li>
